  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Sucrose hydrolyses in acid solution into glucose and fructose following first order rate law with a half-life of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;After <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;the fraction of sucrose remaining is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is ________&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;(Rounded off to the nearest integer)</p><p>[Assume: In<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn></math>]</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "81",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>hr</mi></mrow><mi>order</mi></munderover><munder><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow><mi>Glucose</mi></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow><mi>Fructose</mi></munder></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>hr</mi><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mi>t</mi></msub></math></p><p>from I order kinetic:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfrac><msub><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>693</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>23</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>03</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>81246</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>81</mn></math></p>",
